msgid "PostgreSQL Setup and Operations"
msgstr "PostgreSQL 安装与运维"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:10
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self layer, and related data.\n"
#| "> Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md).\n"
#| "> Security and credentials: [`security.md`](security.md).\n"
msgid ""
"> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self layer, and related data.\n"
"> Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../cognition/memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../cognition/sleep.md).\n"
"> Security and credentials: [`security.md`](security.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"> 逸灵风使用 PostgreSQL 存储对话存档、语义记忆、自我层及相关数据。\n"
"> 相关概念：[`memory.md`](../concepts/memory.md)、[`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md)。\n"
"> 安全与凭证：[`security.md`](security.md)。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Configuration"
msgstr "连接配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:14
msgid "Set the database URL in `config.yaml`:"
msgstr "在 `config.yaml` 中设置数据库 URL："

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/database.md:15
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "database:\n"
#| "  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
#| "  # or use env() / vault():\n"
#| "  # url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgid ""
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # or use env() (bootstrap cannot resolve vault() — Vault lives in PG):\n"
"  # url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgstr ""
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # 或使用 env() / vault()：\n"
"  # url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer Vault or `env()` for "
#| "passwords instead of plaintext in config. Path conventions: "
#| "[`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgid ""
"Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer `env(\"DATABASE_URL\")` over "
"plaintext passwords in `config.yaml` (Vault is unavailable at cold start). "
"Path conventions: [`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""
"生产环境**必须**设置 `database.url`。密码优先使用 Vault 或 `env()`，避免在配"
"置中明文存放。路径约定见 [`security.md`](security.md#credential-"
"responsibilities)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:25
msgid ""
"Optional pool overrides（见 [`src/host/core/db/pg/client.ts`](../../src/host/"
"core/db/pg/client.ts)）:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:31
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Capability        | Description                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
#| "| `memory_recall`   | Four sources: semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; conversation returns snippet |\n"
#| "| `sessions_search` | Session message search; returns snippet (not full content)                                             |\n"
#| "| `memory_remember` | Semantic memory CRUD during conversation                                                               |\n"
#| "| Resident memory   | System prompt injection (not recall)                                                                   |\n"
msgid ""
"| Env                              | Default | Notes                                                                     |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_MAX`          | `10`    | 连接池上限，对齐部署 `max_connections`                                    |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_IDLE_TIMEOUT` | `0`     | 秒；`0` = 关闭。Bun ≤1.3.14 勿设 `30`（会误杀长查询，见 troubleshooting） |\n"
"| `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_MAX_LIFETIME` | `0`     | 秒；`0` = 不限制连接寿命                                                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 能力              | 说明                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `memory_recall`   | 四源：semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical；Top N；conversation 返回 snippet            |\n"
"| `sessions_search` | 会话消息搜索；返回 snippet（非全文）                                                                   |\n"
"| `memory_remember` | 对话中语义记忆 CRUD                                                                                    |\n"
"| Resident memory   | system prompt 注入（非 recall）                                                                        |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local Install (Debian)"
msgstr "本地安装（Debian）"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/database.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh\n"
"\n"
"# config.yaml (example):\n"
"#   url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"
msgstr ""
"# Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)\n"
"sudo ./scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh\n"
"\n"
"# config.yaml (example):\n"
"#   url: env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:43
msgid ""
"Defaults: PostgreSQL 17, `localhost` only, `scram-sha-256`, dedicated "
"`anima` database and user."
msgstr ""
"默认：PostgreSQL 17、仅 `localhost`、`scram-sha-256`、专用 `anima` 数据库与用"
"户。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extensions (One-Time)"
msgstr "扩展（一次性）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:47
msgid ""
"Full-text and vector search require PostgreSQL extensions. The app user "
"usually cannot `CREATE EXTENSION`; run as superuser:"
msgstr ""
"全文与向量检索需要 PostgreSQL 扩展。应用用户通常无法 `CREATE EXTENSION`；请以"
"超级用户执行："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/database.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f core/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:54
msgid ""
"Fresh Debian installs via `setup-postgres-debian.sh` handle extensions "
"automatically."
msgstr "通过 `setup-postgres-debian.sh` 全新安装的 Debian 会自动处理扩展。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schema Migrations"
msgstr "Schema 迁移"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/database.md:59
msgid ""
"**Production (recommended):** When PostgreSQL is configured, `anima service` "
"**auto-applies** pending schema migrations on startup."
msgstr ""
"**生产环境（推荐）：** 配置 PostgreSQL 后，`anima service` 启动时会**自动应用"
"**待执行的 schema 迁移。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/database.md:59
msgid "**Manual:**"
msgstr "**手动：**"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/database.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://anima:…@127.0.0.1:5432/anima\" \\\n"
"  just db migrate\n"
msgstr ""
"DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://anima:…@127.0.0.1:5432/anima\" \\\n"
"  just db migrate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:66
msgid "Run after extensions are installed, or restart `anima service`."
msgstr "安装扩展后执行，或重启 `anima service`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "`auto_llm_runs` (audit)"
msgstr "`auto_llm_runs`（审计）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:70
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Background LLM without user turns (cron agent, sleep pipeline stages) "
#| "writes to `auto_llm_runs` instead of creating `conversations`. Retention "
#| "(optional `config.yaml`):"
msgid ""
"Background LLM without user turns (cron agent, sleep pipeline stages) writes "
"to `auto_llm_runs` instead of creating `conversations`. Retention (Habitat "
"runtime / Shell **Settings → Habitat 服务 → 服务配置** `auto_llm`):"
msgstr ""
"无用户轮次的后台 LLM（cron agent、睡眠流水线阶段）写入 `auto_llm_runs`，而非"
"创建 `conversations`。保留策略（可选 `config.yaml`）："

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/ops/database.md:71
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "auto_llm:\n"
#| "  retention_days: 30\n"
#| "  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"
msgid ""
"# habitat_runtime_config fragment (not config.yaml)\n"
"auto_llm:\n"
"  retention_days: 30\n"
"  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"
msgstr ""
"auto_llm:\n"
"  retention_days: 30\n"
"  per_run_kind_keep: 100\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:79
msgid ""
"Purged during sleep-cycle step `conversation-cleanup` (after stale "
"conversation cleanup). Cron script runs (`no_agent`) use `cron_log` only."
msgstr ""
"在 sleep-cycle 步骤 `conversation-cleanup`（过期对话清理之后）中清除。Cron 脚"
"本运行（`no_agent`）仅使用 `cron_log`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backups"
msgstr "备份"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/database.md:86
msgid ""
"**Migrations do not replace backups** — schedule regular full backups (e.g. "
"`pg_dump`)."
msgstr "**迁移不能替代备份** — 请定期安排全量备份（如 `pg_dump`）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/database.md:86
msgid "Back up before destructive changes."
msgstr "破坏性变更前先备份。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/database.md:86
msgid ""
"Include `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) in backup policy — see "
"[`security.md`](security.md#data-persistence)."
msgstr ""
"备份策略应包含 `~/.anima/`（可用 `FREEANIMA_HOME` 覆盖）——见 [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#data-persistence)。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/database.md:86
msgid ""
"Recommended local stack: hourly `pg_dump` + home tar (short retention), WAL "
"archive (`archive_mode`), weekly `pg_basebackup` for PITR. Restore logical "
"dumps as postgres superuser (`pg_restore --no-owner --no-acl --no-comments`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/database.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integration Tests (Developers)"
msgstr "集成测试（开发者）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:90
msgid ""
"Full integration tests require **Docker** for a temporary PostgreSQL "
"instance:"
msgstr "完整集成测试需要 **Docker** 提供临时 PostgreSQL 实例："

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/ops/database.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"just qa test-integration\n"
"just qa test-integration -- tests/integration/memory/foo.test.ts\n"
"just test              # unit + integration（串行）\n"
msgstr ""
"just qa test-integration\n"
"just qa test-integration -- tests/integration/memory/foo.test.ts\n"
"just test              # unit + integration（串行）\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:98
msgid "pre-commit `just qa test-changed` does **not** run integration tests."
msgstr "pre-commit 的 `just qa test-changed` **不会**运行集成测试。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:108
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                                             | Check                                                                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| --------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Service fails on DB connect                         | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; `env()` refs resolvable if used; startup error message lists next steps (missing DB, auth, connection, extensions)                  |\n"
"| `Idle timeout reached after 30s` on startup/migrate | Bun ≤1.3.14 会误杀进行中查询（[oven-sh/bun#30646](https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues/30646)）。确保 `FREEANIMA_PG_POOL_IDLE_TIMEOUT=0`（默认）或临时导出该变量后重启 |\n"
"| Habitat 「未就绪」超时而进程仍在跑                  | 迁移在 HTTP listen **之前**；默认等 15min（`FREEANIMA_HABITAT_READY_TIMEOUT_MS`）。看 `journalctl --user -u anima -f`，勿中途 `stop`                                    |\n"
"| Migration fails                                     | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges；HNSW / 大批量 backfill 可能很慢，勿与上述 idle timeout 混淆                                                           |\n"
"| FTS / keyword recall empty                          | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied (`pg_trgm`); jieba/FTS rebuild if needed                                                                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/database.md:109
msgid "More deployment security: [`security.md`](security.md)."
msgstr "更多部署安全事项：[`security.md`](security.md)。"
